(7692073, 1260643, 114969, '<td valign="top">I really like the clever composition, showing perfectly how the peacock thinks highly of itself. The pastel colors in the background are also wonderful. Congratulations on the ribbon!</td>', 'I really like the clever composition, showing perfectly how the peacock thinks highly of itself. The pastel colors in the background are also wonderful. Congratulations on the ribbon!', '2021-04-19 17:30:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(7692074, 1260639, 173844, '<td valign="top">It''s a very fine image, though I now know from your commentary that I hadn''t understood what your intention was.  From your explanation I can appreciation your ideas and implementation.  It''s wonderful to see your empathy for, and intuition about, animals and their complex, rich lives.  And about their subtle feelings and emotions.  It''s interesting that we can broaden our "humanity" by according all creatures what is all too often claimed for ourselves alone.  Thank you.</td>', 'It''s a very fine image, though I now know from your commentary that I hadn''t understood what your intention was.  From your explanation I can appreciation your ideas and implementation.  It''s wonderful to see your empathy for, and intuition about, animals and their complex, rich lives.  And about their subtle feelings and emotions.  It''s interesting that we can broaden our "humanity" by according all creatures what is all too often claimed for ourselves alone.  Thank you.', '2021-04-19 17:39:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(7692083, 1260642, 114969, '<td valign="top">I agree with the other comments, the painterly effect works wonderfully here: it would be perfect for a book cover. Stylish and elegant. Congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'I agree with the other comments, the painterly effect works wonderfully here: it would be perfect for a book cover. Stylish and elegant. Congrats on the ribbon!', '2021-04-19 20:26:26.000000', NULL, 0),
